analysis/arctic_volume.jl: the box of wet surface cells reachable from the pole without crossing the Davis, Fram, BSO
or Bering sections (stops and draws the path if the sections do not close the Arctic), its mean sea level from the
daily η against the integrated net inflow through the four sections, by calendar month (arctic_volume.md,
arctic_volume.png). For the four-month runs of 24 Nov, whose gateways summed to +0.7 to +4.4 Sv into the Arctic.

The scorecard now also runs plotting/volume_budget.jl and arctic_volume.jl and adds both budgets: the domain-mean η
against GLORYS's, through the sides and the surface, the largest residual (should be 0), and the Arctic table.

